  "id": "pat",
  "term": "PAT",
  "definition": "PAT refers to psychedelic-assisted therapy, a complex clinical approach that combines neurochemical effects with structured therapeutic care. Its assessment is described as multidimensional, covering preparation before sessions, the acute experience, the therapy process, later integration, outcomes, and safety rather than focusing only on symptom change.",
